{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "5f22ec5c02840fd28224ce10b4e89c8d78e2741dea614ef70df8209ce544c64a", "ja": "イノベーション", "zh": "创新", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2b26bf7caac66a1ecb7c6bb60923d14af72605470c2e76fd650d48b662828076", "ja": "ヨルノオルカのアマチュア時代の魅力を詰め\n込んだプレゼン資料を作り、本人に読んでも\nらおうとするロコ。プロデューサーやみんな\nに止められ正気に戻ったものの、まだ納得は\nできていない様子。", "zh": "制作了一份满载夜之虎鲸业余时期魅力的演示资料，想让本人读一读的ROCO。虽然被制作人和大家劝住后恢复了理智，但看起来还是没能接受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0c229b9ba20a39f658ca7f263f39d0508c25767e825094f3f0f3eda903a7bd0f", "ja": "（今日は朝からロコを見ていない。劇場には\n来ているみたいなんだけど、連絡もつかないし……）", "zh": "（今天一早就没见到ROCO。好像是来剧场了，但也联系不上……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "82d55508ab066ad3e7c565ea89960f5691a75cc4ddb840f85a02ea3d155ade7a", "ja": "ふふふ……この記事は使えそうですね！\nこっちのデータはグラフにして……ふふふ！", "zh": "呵呵呵……这篇报道应该派得上用场！\n这边的数据做成图表……呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a57d0dc4bbe9910924318522e54246a5adafcc4ca4d642aba3a971252badb3d0", "ja": "ん？　この声は……？", "zh": "嗯？这个声音是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_1003_p", "source_sha256": "9133f3da0d51416282a87a4db4b55f33f8f7aaac125c51d0dd200cd88b519e91", "ja": "あ、やっぱり、ロコ！\nこんなところに居たのか……何してるんだ？", "zh": "啊，果然是ROCO！\n原来你在这里……在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "22d327b4a2031377a63865fa7fec0f67a63b14df2a9ef735e4cfab2e6550df74", "ja": "{$P$}！　ええと、\nロコは今、みんなに提出するためのエビデンスを……。", "zh": "{$P$}！呃，这个，ROCO现在正在整理要提交给大家的证据……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "a4e2735a83d4b0e33e83d0a9ed198243110e4674a57fc1e27156814d493e032d", "ja": "アッ！　みんなこっち！　ロコ居たヨ～！", "zh": "啊！大家看这边！ROCO在这里哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "5d4f91086907ef2ec6c30408585bd8b815a2204408e200abdf3844f74864593d", "ja": "ロコちゃん！　よかった～……。", "zh": "ROCO！太好了～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "be290ab0d3bee432ea1835afe380a54fd99ae5fbbceb3a4ca37355100921044a", "ja": "エレナ、イク！　それに、カオリとアンナも。\nみんな揃って、どうしたんですか？", "zh": "艾莲娜、育！还有歌织和杏奈也来了。\n大家都到齐了，是怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "251c930718f47da39b15b50940cbe2b649ed57932b15857dfe5014ed4ee31966", "ja": "どうしたんですか、じゃない……。\nみんなで心配して、探してたの……。", "zh": "不是“怎么了”……是大家都很担心，一直在找你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_1009_052kao", "source_sha256": "9ad9703c79a6a2bf43a2717f98ef3a1f7428c1f5bb259e49c07a04c1c802ca3a", "ja": "ええ。昨日は急に出て行ってしまったし、\nそろそろレッスンも始まるからって。", "zh": "嗯，因为你昨天突然就出去了，而且训练也快要开始了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "201f53feaec9d509c79f989039252a5e7629488132e3034a0c25c340c64b067e", "ja": "ええっ！？　そ、ソーリーです！　レッスンには\n間に合わせるつもりだったんですけど……。", "zh": "诶！？对、对不起！本来是打算赶上训练的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_1011_p", "source_sha256": "23275e1c3fec03a7967603301680609380dbf3a03d0e7627aee16a2ed64aeafe", "ja": "間に合わせるって……何を？", "zh": "“赶上”……赶上什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "ddb6a272075aa7044abacaed51779c8d6c9d5c6cd8a809f12cd02717f818eb7a", "ja": "ふふふ……投稿者『Q』の魅力をわかって\nもらえるような、資料を作っていたんですよ♪", "zh": "呵呵呵……我在制作一份资料，希望大家能理解投稿者“Q”的魅力♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_1013_025roc", "source_sha256": "ea18577b561574b31f4bd32aadc4d6e1c3737bcf040078fc6e28cae966943217", "ja": "芸能誌から抜粋したり、ネットの\nオピニオンを纏めたり……動画の解釈とか！", "zh": "从娱乐杂志里摘录，汇总网上的各种观点……还有视频解读什么的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "73cf4a5123c31d9acb19eb2448cba8243e5254d63faf0381863d2c4169f5eedf", "ja": "その分厚い資料、一日で作ったノ～！？\nすごいネ～！　でもそれ、作ってどうするノ？", "zh": "这么厚的资料，是一天做出来的——！？  \n好厉害呀——！不过，做这个是要干什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "de2bdcb7bfd1dc4ee5b818412eef7628cf659669c8c197a187d5bb7327aa961b", "ja": "もちろん、みんなにプレゼンするんですよ。\nそれから……ヨルノにも、読んでもらいます！", "zh": "当然是要向大家做展示呀。\n还有……也要让夜野读一读！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "b4dee42b1a6c4c6e3b14544eb3e2feab2aab51ddb2825a99e0fe3c78a31589e1", "ja": "えっ！？　ヨルノさん本人に？", "zh": "咦！？要让约尔诺本人读吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "568403b38bfa7c29714ab1c000d2f258c609a046e3ef68a2afe2813ccd3f3e77", "ja": "イエスです！　これを読めばきっと、\nソウルとパッションを思い出してもらえるはず……。", "zh": "没错！只要读了这个，应该就能让她回想起灵魂与热情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_1018", "source_sha256": "3947f85de9fe43191269923de37294fd5917da7197c8d25c1eebf73254544b9f", "ja": "ストップ！", "zh": "Stop！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_2000_p", "source_sha256": "c2862944c289b1e6a352e35c74183cf3cc07228430364c25b307c4e95a4488a9", "ja": "ロコ、ちょっと待って。\nその努力は凄いと思うけど、本人に見せるのは……。", "zh": "ROCO，等一下。\n我觉得你的努力很了不起，不过要拿给本人看就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_2001_025roc", "source_sha256": "24235f2ec4fe163ab67e0beec5e7f5ecf564c02200d4f8d8e1928c7eb6317458", "ja": "はっ……！？　そ、そうですよね、\nさすがにルードなムーブでした……うう。", "zh": "哈……！？确、确实是这样呢，  \n这种举动实在是太粗鲁了……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_2002_024ann", "source_sha256": "02c37e09de8f6f7c3685c5a5e2d89e5a6d938ce1711cb848392a84447617d7e5", "ja": "ん……杏奈は、見たいけど……。\n本人は、微妙な気持ちになると思う……。", "zh": "嗯……杏奈虽然也想看……\n但觉得本人心里……会挺复杂的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_2003_052kao", "source_sha256": "da2cf8694ea8087bc4ded5205e78f0a2189857b2a4bec545aa6f43520404f7c6", "ja": "ええ、今のヨルノオルカさんの活動を、\n否定することになっちゃうかも知れないものね。", "zh": "是啊，这样或许会变成否定如今夜之虎鲸小姐的活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_2004_025roc", "source_sha256": "d2a3a57b21c4880e48f6607579faaf7124298ff9ee1658e864c006f1467af3b2", "ja": "……っ！　そ、そうですね……。\nそれは、ロコのインテンションではないです……。", "zh": "……！　是、是这样呢……。\n那并不是ROCO的意图……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_2005_025roc", "source_sha256": "3048a855afed5b99928c68ecc6e8ebe4d098ecdf608dfba780db8acae7c51ac3", "ja": "ロコは、今のアクティビティを\n否定したいわけじゃなくて、ただ……。", "zh": "ROCO并不是想否定现在的活动，只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_2006_030iku", "source_sha256": "78cae0ea2a2e2d340dae72c543a70e8228263b43b7fee57f3dff073d46953a4e", "ja": "ロコちゃん、わたしもわかるよ。変わっちゃった\nものって、なっとくするのが難しいよね。", "zh": "ROCO，我也明白。已经改变的东西，很难让人接受，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_2007_025roc", "source_sha256": "9dedf30ea7fbcd0a44c01f25093f3e8d219b64c96de29134709ae3b46dcaaceb", "ja": "イク……？", "zh": "育……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_2008_030iku", "source_sha256": "72864a9f043417b1287cb6484a6f565473fe09369b768a6047c1d3cf2754cad7", "ja": "前にね、クラスの友達に言われたの。\n「育ちゃん、変わったね」って。", "zh": "以前啊，班上的朋友对我说过：\n“育，你变了呢。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_2009_030iku", "source_sha256": "860b431f2c0863cb463b6ead5a9b5bd64d48d415357bfd44f665454a5c26b246", "ja": "アイドルになって、いそがしくなって……。\nお休みの日に、一緒に遊べなくなっちゃったから。", "zh": "成为偶像之后，变得忙了起来……所以休息日没办法再和她们一起玩了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_2010_030iku", "source_sha256": "701c8e971d2d9d2dfa7128bd0e1afc7f4d476b16308dedd1e25361aea8b7946f", "ja": "でもね、わたし思ったの！　たしかにさみしいけど、\n今は劇場のみんなもいるから、平気だなって！", "zh": "不过，我想到了！虽然确实有点寂寞，但现在剧场里还有大家陪着我，所以没关系了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_2011_018ele", "source_sha256": "bced9fee9dc297bee94e883985849e6c2783ce1c852c37970a4f0d03f18f4871", "ja": "ワタシも、日本に来てすぐは、\n友達と離れてすごく寂しかったケド……。", "zh": "我刚来到日本的时候，也因为和朋友分开而感到非常寂寞，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_2012_018ele", "source_sha256": "d4adf651aaeb22b176e8737ccb5f861f7497e7661da646e00160feea23012193", "ja": "でもね、ママンや家族のみんながいてくれたおかげで、\n平気だったノ！　今は劇場のみんなもいるしネ♪", "zh": "不过呢，多亏有妈妈和家人们陪着我，所以我没事哦！现在剧场的大家也都在我身边了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_2013_p", "source_sha256": "c8713ac8f32856d0867b4738e27b97443dc636fcd5cb70c07cf46e12e0d836f1", "ja": "そうか……ふたりも今まで、\n色々な変化を受け入れて来たんだな。", "zh": "这样啊……原来你们两个人至今也接受了各种各样的变化啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_2014_052kao", "source_sha256": "6e398ca72153a9905eaadd3f05d541db175864e1be331ee3a9114b3dc9c88d6b", "ja": "そういうのって、誰でもありますよね。\n変わりたくないと思っても、変わってしまう……。", "zh": "这种事，谁都会遇到吧。\n即使不想改变，也还是会发生改变……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_2015_052kao", "source_sha256": "76e84c155aff4a1da6c526b64d0f25af6166eb320638d400eb8532498d89b43c", "ja": "何とか受け入れて、乗り越えていくしかなくて。\nそうやって、自分も成長していくのかも。", "zh": "只能想办法接受，然后跨越过去。\n或许自己也是这样一点点成长起来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_2016_024ann", "source_sha256": "72d04329cde9c080b70e70adac31c7617b720aaa9ce4141519d00b7be7557b03", "ja": "ロコも……いつも言ってる、よね……？\nイノベーションです、って。", "zh": "ROCO也……总是这么说，对吧……？\n说这是创新。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_2017_024ann", "source_sha256": "ee9b6d8d2f9dd3fbfbd2255c030f79cebd5783717b77981db5df1c8d38f89421", "ja": "新しく、変わっていくこと……。\nそれも、イノベーション……じゃない？", "zh": "不断创新、不断变化……这些也算是创新……不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_2018_025roc", "source_sha256": "46e1a870bbd128f615124f1f078ce6550098278482c2433701a5ad9e8c840112", "ja": "む、むむむ……！\n確かに、それは……そうかもですけど……！", "zh": "唔、唔唔唔……！\n确实，那确实……也许是这样没错……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_2019_052kao", "source_sha256": "217acf4012a4658cf5a847e742a68dec734d1b35d0e9b8f127bd4185f034e2e3", "ja": "大丈夫。少しずつ、受け入れていけばいいのよ。\n一度に全部、納得するのは難しいだろうし……。", "zh": "没事的。一点点去接受就好。\n毕竟想一次全部想通也很难吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_2020_018ele", "source_sha256": "bac3e20330a0dfe6d89a8841d52213bb4d3998939d1da7154bbf53fce3e7744e", "ja": "相談なら乗るヨ～♪　それとも一緒に気分転換する？　\n楽しい気持ちになれば、少し変わるカモ！", "zh": "如果想找人聊聊，我可以听你说哦～♪　还是说，要不要一起换换心情？\n只要开心起来，说不定就会有些改变哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_2021_025roc", "source_sha256": "163602bfd8d21b7ed949e62858afb3355bb728dcbfefe19dc756718d930be0de", "ja": "みんな、クールですね……。\nロコも、頭ではアンダースタンドですけど……ううっ。", "zh": "大家都很冷静呢……。\nROCO在脑子里也是能理解的，可是……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_2022_p", "source_sha256": "797c4a75541f8ba28d5441e0d0ca6f5b4eccbc6a8236372ae6c0bb7c44e14975", "ja": "（すぐに納得するのは、難しいのかもしれない……。\nまあ、ひとまずはレッスンに集中してもらおう）", "zh": "（或许很难马上接受吧……不过，先让她们集中精力上课吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_04_2023_p", "source_sha256": "7c44a66e414c2c5653e39cc83e7c8ab159ae67183412038cf43cb7548354c68e", "ja": "（それで気が紛れることも、あるかもしれないしな）", "zh": "（说不定这样也能让她分散一下注意力。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
